1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cadet at Karlberg Military Academy 1811-16. Quartermaster in the Skåne Carabineer Regiment 1816. Cornet in the Skåne Dragoon Regiment. Lieutenant 1821. Cavalry Captain 1840. Retired 1856 and settled in Denmark. Kni
2 CONC ght of the Order of the Sword. 
