1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Anders Appelbom=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Johan Andersson Appelbom and Anna Probsting von Elbingen
2 CONT * Anders Appelbom , born November 10 , 1652 in Dorpt , died May 22, 1721 in Stockholm , was a Swedish military man .
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Anders_Appelbom_(1652-1721)&wprov=rarw1 Anders Appelbom (1652-1721), Swedish Baron and Admiral]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biography'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders Appelbom was born in 1652 in Dorpt . He was the son of Major Johan Appelbom and Anna Probsting. Appelbom became a student at Uppsala University in September 1659. He was made a baron on 18 June 1719 and was introduced into 
2 CONC the knighthood as Appelbom with number 164. Appelbom died in 1721 in Stockholm and was buried in Vallentuna Church . [ 2 ]
2 CONT Appelbom owned the farms Kristineholm in Lohärad parish and Sörby in Fellingsbro parish . [ 2 ]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Appelbom married for the first time in 1691 to Catharina Margareta von Schönfelt (1659–1692). She was the daughter of assessor Greger von Schönfeldt of the von Schönfelt family and Catharina Stiernhöök. They had one son together (
2 CONC 1692–1692).
2 CONT
2 CONT Appelbom married a second time in 1697 to Brita Kristina Clerck (1675–1757). She was the daughter of the president Hans Clerck of the Göta Court of Appeal and Anna Bure. Together they had the children Magdalena Christina Appelbom 
2 CONC (1698–1777) who was married to the president Gustaf Adolf Lagerfelt , Carl Appelbom and Otto Johan Appelbom (1708–1720). After Anders Appelbom's death, Brita Kristina Clerck remarried to the chief director Hans Ehrenpreus.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Appelbom_nr_164 Apple Tree no. 164, Coat of Arms of the Baronial Family Appelbon no. 164]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Anders Appelbom, Baron Appelbom (son of Johan Appelbom ),''' born 10 November 1652 in Dorpt. Died 22 May 1721 in Stockholm. Admiral. Baron 1719. Married 1st in 1691 to his cousin's daughter Catharina Margareta von Schönfelt , d
2 CONC aughter of assessor Greger Wallander von Schönfelt and Catharina Stiernhöök . Married 2nd in 1697 to Baroness Brita Christina. 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children from second marriage to Brita Christina Clerck:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Magdalena Christina Appelbom,''' born 16 May 1698, died 1777-04-01 in Linköping. Married 1720-05-01 in Stockholm to Baron Gustaf Adolf Lagerfelt .
2 CONT * '''Carl Appelbom,''' died young.
2 CONT * '''Otto Johan Appelbom,''' born 1708, died 1720.
2 CONT
