1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Anders Samuelsson Appelbom=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Samuel Appelbom and Maria Dress
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married '''Anna Dorotea Löfling ,''' daughter of assessor Johan Löfling and Elisabet Anrep .
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Appelbom_nr_325#TAB_12 Noble Family Appelbom no. 325]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TAB 12'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders Appelbom (son of Samuel Appelbom, tab 11 ). Born 1654. Horsemaster in the Uppland Three-Man Cavalry Regiment. Died 1702-06-02 in Poland from wounds received. Married Anna Dorotea Löfling , daughter of assessor Johan Löfling
2 CONC  and Elisabet Anrep .
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=  
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Elisabet''', born 1685, died 1697-01-10 in Fellingsbro, Orebro, Sweden..
2 CONT * '''Carl Samuel,''' born 1686. Major. Died 1744. son of Anders Appelbom, tab 12 ), born 10/10/1686. Died 18/04/1744 at the lieutenant's residence Stora Horn in Horn parish. Major. Married 1st 6/10/1719 in Tumen in Siberia, during
2 CONC  Russian captivity, to Brita Christina Skogh , born in Ingermanland, daughter of cavalry master Claes Johan Skogh and Margareta Elisabet Armfelt (SoH 1997). Married 2nd 26/06/1729 to Magdalena Christina Julin , daughter of the mil
2 CONC l owner at Nyhammar Anders Julin and Christina Remmer .
2 CONT * '''Johan Anders''', born 1688. Factory owner. (son of Anders Appelbom, tab 12 ). Born 1688. Factory owner in Österhammar. Married to Elisabet Falck , daughter of the cavalry commander of the Smaland cavalry regiment Peter Falck 
2 CONC and Maria Gahm .
2 CONT * '''Anna Christina''', born 1691-11-01, died 1701 in Österhammar.
2 CONT * '''Märta Helena''', baptized 1696-01-26 in Österhammar, died 1767-06-26 in Masku vicarage in Finland. Married in 1718 to the lieutenant in the Uusimaa regiment Lars Björnram .
2 CONT * '''Carl''', born 1699-09-04, died 1701 in Österhammar.
2 CONT * '''Anna Dorotea,''' born 1700, died 1754. Married 1724-09-15 in Österhammar to the mill owner at Grönbo mill Anders Ahlbom .
2 CONT * '''Maria Catharina,''' died unmarried in 1739.
2 CONT * '''Elisabet,''' born 1708-04-22, died 1778-04-22 at Krokgården in Fullösa parish. Married 1st before 1731 to lieutenant Johan Friberg . Married 2nd 1739-10-12 in Forshem parish to sergeant Per Hansson Silfverswärd .
