1 NAME Carl Adolph /Fahlstedt/
2 GIVN Carl Adolph
2 SURN Fahlstedt
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 19 APR 1788
2 PLAC Tiurala
2 ADDR
3 CITY Lempäälä
3 CTRY Finland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 JUL 1841
