1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gregor_Adlercreutz '''Gregor Nils Henric Adlercreutz'''] was a Swedish equestrian who competed in the 1936 Summer Olympics. He and his horse Teresina placed fourth in the individual d
2 CONC ressage competition and won a bronze medal with the Swedish dressage team. Adlercreutz was captain in the Scanian cavalry regiment and studied at a cavalry school in Hanover in 1937–38. His father Nils was also an Olympic equestri
2 CONC an and headed the Scanian regiment in 1921–27.
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gregor_Adlercreutz '''Gregor Nils Henrik Adlercreutz'''], född 16 augusti 1898 i Stockholm, död 3 juni 1944 i Strömsholm, var en svensk dressyrryttare. Han blev olympisk bronsmedaljör i Berlin 1936.
