1 NAME Christian /Thott/
2 GIVN Christian
2 _MARNM Thott
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 2 DEC 1770
2 PLAC Skabersjö
2 ADDR
3 CITY Svedala
3 CTRY Sweden
