1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Arvid Mauritz Posse=
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Wikipedia===
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arvid_Mauritz_Posse '''Arvid Mauritz Posse'''] was a Swedish politician, count and Marshal of the Realm, who served as Prime Minister for Justice in 1840 and between 1846–1848.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Posse was born into''' a noble family, as the son of Count and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lord_of_the_Realm Lord of the Realm] Arvid Erik Posse and his wife, the baroness Catharina Charlotta von Otter. The family was of Jut
2 CONC landic origin and belonged to the high nobility, having been raised to countship in 1706. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Posse received his''' education at Lund University. He went on to work at Göta Court of Appeal and later became an assessor at the Svea Court of Appeal in 1816. Prior to his appointment as Prime Minister for Justice, Posse had 
2 CONC served as governor of Skaraborg County as well as director-general of the Swedish Customs Service.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''By 1840, Posse became''' known for his liberal positions in matters concerning free trade in the Riksdag of the Estates and following the government resignation in 1840, the king had him appointed Prime Minister for Justice. Th
2 CONC is was done in order to ease the pressure from the liberal opposition. However, his term at the office become short and Posse was forced to resign later that same year. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''During the Riksdag of''' 1845, Posse was appointed [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marshal_of_the_Realm_(Sweden%29 Marshal of the Realm]. This eventually lead to him being appointed for a second time as Prime Minister for Justic
2 CONC e in the government of 1846. Following the political turmoil after the March Unrest and due to popular protests against the government, Posse resigned from his office in 1848 along with his most of his cabinet.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''In 1849, due to his''' declining health Posse resigned as Marshal of the Realm and died the following year in Gothenburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''He was the uncle''' of Prime Minister [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marshal_of_the_Realm_(Sweden%29 '''Arvid Posse'''].
2 CONT
2 CONT /////
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Adelsvapen===
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Posse_nr_51#TAB_34 '''Arvid Mauritz Posse'''], född 1792-01-05 [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bergkvara_(gods%29 Bergkvara]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kanslist i Göta''' hovrätt 1813. Häradshövding 1814. Assessor 1816. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Tjänstgörande''' kammarherre hos drottning Hedvig Elisabet Charlotta 1817. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lagman i Skåne''' 1821. Tillförordnad vice landshövding i Linköpings län 1822. Landshövding i Skaraborgs län 1824. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Justitiestatsminister''' och en av rikets herrar 1840. Lantmarskalk vid 1844 års urtima riksdag. Riksmarskalk 1845. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Död 1850-07-22''' i Göteborg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gift 1825-06-04''' i Linköpings domkyrka med friherrinnan [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Von_Platen_nr_126 '''Juliana Lovisa von Platen'''], dotter av en av rikets herrar mm, greve Baltzar Bogislav von Platen och Hedvig 
2 CONC Elisabet Ekman.
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT <br/>
